  "description": ".NET for Mac Catalyst / .NET MAUI bindings for the native Datadog iOS SDK's DatadogTrace framework: distributed tracing (APM), spans, and trace-context propagation across Datadog, B3 and W3C tracecontext headers. Built against dd-sdk-ios 3.14.0. The DD* managed API for this module is bound in this package, matching DatadogNet.Trace.iOS.",
